  the global shortcut (DETOUR_GLOBAL_HOTKEY=1 turns it on)."
  (out3/N1-debug-no-opt-in-light/dark.png). Found here: the File menu item
  kept Opt-Cmd-N, because only start() followed the settings; fixed (the
  settings observer lives for the object's life), after which the item
  showed Ctrl-Opt-Cmd-F12 and pressing it in Detour opened the panel
  through the menu.
- With the opt-in, posted clicks while the recorder was recording: on the
  checkbox, recording ended and the hotkey was registered again, then the
  checkbox's own action turned it off (a second click turned it on); on
  empty space right of the recorder, recording ended and it was registered;
  on the General toolbar item, recording ended, registered, General shown;
  the hotkey then opened the panel.

